  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.7,
      "text": "好 在之前的课程中我们学习了开场极吸引的秘诀",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07091929521230818,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00001"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.7,
      "end": 6.68,
      "text": "以及搭讪时你必须所要具备的焚觉心态",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07091929521230818,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00002"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.68,
      "end": 10.0,
      "text": "那么这一节课中我将给你们传授一套新手小白",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07091929521230818,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00003"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.0,
      "end": 12.72,
      "text": "也能无脑掌握的搭讪SOP全流程",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07091929521230818,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00004"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.72,
      "end": 14.44,
      "text": "不过我先说一句实在话",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07091929521230818,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00005"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.44,
      "end": 17.18,
      "text": "我个人搭讪其实是没有任何的固定流程的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07091929521230818,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00006"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.18,
      "end": 20.6,
      "text": "因为我到一定程度之后很多东西已经融进我的身体里了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07091929521230818,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00007"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.6,
      "end": 23.58,
      "text": "我不需要去想 我自然而然的就能使用出来",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07091929521230818,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00008"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.58,
      "end": 26.42,
      "text": "但我发现对于刚开始搭讪的新手小白来说",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07091929521230818,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00009"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.42,
      "end": 29.0,
      "text": "没有一套流程他们根本完全无法行动",
      "avg_logprob": -0.07091929521230818,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00010"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.0,
      "end": 30.22,
      "text": "他们不知道该说什么",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00011"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.22,
      "end": 31.12,
      "text": "不知道该做什么",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00012"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.12,
      "end": 33.0,
      "text": "上去之后就是硬撑着聊",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00013"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.0,
      "end": 33.74,
      "text": "聊到冷场",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00014"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.74,
      "end": 34.66,
      "text": "那么这种感觉",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00015"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.66,
      "end": 36.08,
      "text": "我相信很多人都经历过",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00016"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.08,
      "end": 37.76,
      "text": "而且经历一次两次之后",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00017"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.76,
      "end": 39.66,
      "text": "很多人可能就再也不想搭讪了",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00018"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.66,
      "end": 41.3,
      "text": "所以今天这套SOP流程",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00019"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.3,
      "end": 43.1,
      "text": "是专门给新手准备的",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00020"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.1,
      "end": 44.24,
      "text": "那么在讲流程之前",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00021"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.24,
      "end": 45.36,
      "text": "我先纠正一个",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00022"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.36,
      "end": 46.44,
      "text": "很多新手小白",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00023"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.44,
      "end": 48.24,
      "text": "都会有的一个错误观念",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00024"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.24,
      "end": 48.96,
      "text": "很多人",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00025"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.96,
      "end": 50.98,
      "text": "尤其是受早期自然流风格",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00026"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.98,
      "end": 51.52,
      "text": "影响的人",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00027"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.52,
      "end": 52.94,
      "text": "他们会觉得搭讪",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00028"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.94,
      "end": 54.36,
      "text": "是一定要跟女生一直聊",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00029"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.36,
      "end": 55.42,
      "text": "聊得越久越好",
      "avg_logprob": -0.08615860532758371,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00030"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.42,
