      "end": 64.18,
      "text": "原因很简单",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10733695644975284,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00037"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.18,
      "end": 65.28,
      "text": "在你还没有能力",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10733695644975284,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00038"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.28,
      "end": 67.1,
      "text": "掌控整个对话走向的时候",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10733695644975284,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00039"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.1,
      "end": 68.08,
      "text": "你聊的越多",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10733695644975284,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00040"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.08,
      "end": 69.7,
      "text": "你出错的机会就会越多",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10733695644975284,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00041"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.7,
      "end": 71.48,
      "text": "你掉的吸引也就会越多",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10733695644975284,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00042"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.48,
      "end": 74.12,
      "text": "你与其在那里硬撑着犯错",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10733695644975284,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00043"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.12,
      "end": 75.36,
      "text": "你不如干脆利落",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10733695644975284,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00044"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.36,
      "end": 76.78,
      "text": "快速要的联系方式",
      "avg_logprob": -0.10733695644975284,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "segment_id": "S00045"
    },
    {
